      },
      {
        "source": "issue",
        "quote": "This causes the test failure report to incorrectly claim that 'During handling of the above exception, another exception occurred'."
      },
      {
        "source": "issue",
        "quote": "It should be attached to the `__cause__` attribute instead, such that the connective would be 'The above exception was the direct cause of the following exception', which is more correct."
